#ASSERT `who presides` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the Chairperson`
#ASSERT `who presides` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the temporary Chairperson`
#ASSERT `who presides` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `a member elected by those present`

§ `s 7`

#ASSERT `may chair a sub-committee` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `may chair a sub-committee` FALSE

#ASSERT `may sit on a sub-committee` FALSE
#ASSERT `may sit on a sub-committee` TRUE

#ASSERT `the Committee may delegate` `making accounting standards` `a sub-committee appointed by the Committee`
#ASSERT `the Committee may delegate` `issuing practice directions` `a member of the Committee`
#ASSERT `the Committee may delegate` `appointing sub-committees` `a member of the Committee`
#ASSERT NOT `the Committee may delegate` `the power of delegation` `a sub-committee appointed by the Committee`
#ASSERT NOT `the Committee may delegate` `the power of delegation` `a member of the Committee`
#ASSERT NOT `the Committee may delegate` `making accounting standards` `a person who is not a member`

